# Public updates

Issue comments, pull request text, commit messages, and other text published to this repo are written as the maintainer.

- Thank the person who submitted the update.
- Say the deal list is updated and link https://github.com/MichaelCyger/Domains-Black-Friday-Cyber-Monday when that is the change.
- Do not mention Cursor, the agent, the editor, or how the change was made.

```
